  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Niue Australia Development Programme 2021 - 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Niue Australia bilateral development program 2021-2025 helps advance Niue&#x2019;s goal of developing a stable and broad-based economy by supporting Niue&#x2019;s climate resilient infrastructure, telecommunications, water, sanitation and hygiene, and economic recovery.

The investment aims to enhance Australia&#x2019;s relationship with Niue, including through people-to-people linkages, to complement Australia&#x2019;s other programs in Niue, including, but not limited to, the Australia Awards Pacific Scholarship (AAPS), Direct Assistance Programme (DAP community grants) and wider regional activities. The investment&#x2019;s activities and outcomes are closely aligned with Niue&#x2019;s National Strategic Plan 2016-2026, and in its mission &#x2013; Working Together to Protect the People and the Environment.</narrative>
  </description>
